The key to piloting Yuna, Grand Summoner is understanding its core engine: Yuna acts as a rainbow mana dork that enters subsequent creatures with two bonus +1/+1 counters. When permanent with counters die, she transfers those counters onto other creatures, ensuring threats stay massive.
This is a Bracket 3 build running three Game Changers: Rhystic Study, Smothering Tithe, Cyclonic Rift. It contains zero mass land denial and focuses on high-synergy board development, interactive answers, and an inevitable endgame clock.

# Commander and Core Synergy
Yuna, Grand Summoner :: primary commander driving the deck's core strategy
Hardened Scales :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Ozolith, the Shattered Spire :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
The Ozolith :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Doubling Season :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Kalonian Hydra :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage

